# 5. CORE DESIGN PRINCIPLE

The system shall distinguish between:

### Clinical services

and

### NCD workflows.

For example, laboratory testing is a clinical service and should not be recreated separately for Diabetes, Cardiac or Sickle Cell.

Instead:

```text
Diabetes
   │
   └── requests Laboratory Test
                    │
                    └── Laboratory Module

Cardiac
   │
   └── requests ECG
                    │
                    └── ECG Module

Sickle Cell
   │
   └── requests Laboratory Test
                    │
                    └── Laboratory Module
```

This prevents duplication and allows the same service to be reused across all diseases.

