### Completed clinical record

Should not normally be physically deleted.

Corrections should use:

* Amendment
* Versioning
* Void/correction
* Audit trail

This principle applies to:

* Visits
* Laboratory results
* Diagnoses
* Clinical assessments
* Prescriptions
