# 65. FOLLOW-UP AUTOMATION ALGORITHM

The system shall periodically execute:

```text
1. Find active follow-up plans
2. Identify patients under each plan
3. Determine reference date
4. Find existing future visits
5. Calculate generation window
6. Determine maximum allowed future visits
7. Generate missing visits
8. Prevent duplicate visits
9. Never modify completed visits
10. Apply current future scheduling rules
11. Record audit information
```

