## Core architectural principle

**One NCD platform, one shared clinical core, reusable clinical service modules, configurable disease workflows, reusable follow-up engine, and hierarchical access control from facility to national level.**

There is **no separate Study-level access layer** because the system is fundamentally an **NCD Management Platform**, with the NCD project represented as part of the NCD program rather than as an independent study-management hierarchy.
